OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI chip boom pushes Samsung profits to
OL,4,Arecord $80bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamsung is one of the world's largest
OL,7,Fmemory chip makers alongside local
OL,8,Frival SK Hynix and Micron in the US,
OL,9,Fwhich produce chips crucial for AI
OL,10,Ffirms like Nvidia.
OL,12,FSamsung, which makes the Galaxy Fold
OL,13,Fand S26 smartphones, is also expected
OL,14,Fto get a boost from its latest folding
OL,15,Fdevices that were launched in August.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
