OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVeteran Indian actor Nana Patekar dies
OL,4,Aat 75
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Despite 45 minutes of continuous CPR,
OL,7,Fhe could not be revived," Dr Shekhar
OL,8,FSalkar of Manipal Hospital in Goa told
OL,9,FANI news agency.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
